+
+# Request
+
+Customers ask us to cancel bookings. Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service: it cancels the
+booking at the time `at` and returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, the amount given back (euro cents).
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- Cancelling at least 24 hours before the booking's `start` refunds the booking's full total.
+- Cancelling less than 24 hours before `start` (or after it) refunds 0.
+- A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment: it is free again in `availability` and `book`.
+- A booking can only be cancelled once; a second cancel throws, as does an unknown booking id.
+- An invalid `at` (not an ISO-8601 UTC instant) throws and leaves the booking in place.
